{"4925300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unnamed Pogo Game", "steam_appid": 4925300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every bounce takes you closer to the summit—or sends you all the way back down.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the bottom of an impossible vertical world, you have one tool: a pogo stick. Use momentum, precision, and nerve to launch across giant platforms, surreal environments, and brutal obstacles on a climb that never gives you a second chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no easy route upward. Every landing matters, every jump can change your run, and one bad bounce can wipe out everything you fought to gain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the climb alone, or bring friends into <strong>multiplayer mode</strong>. Race for the summit, challenge each other to survive the hardest sections, or share the pain when somebody falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have the patience, timing, and nerves to reach the top?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925300/extras/8a473fcf66e04f8c2021c431e78fe2c7.poster.avif?t=1788281852\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925300/extras/8a473fcf66e04f8c2021c431e78fe2c7.webm?t=1788281852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925300/extras/8a473fcf66e04f8c2021c431e78fe2c7.mp4?t=1788281852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Physics-Based Pogo Gameplay:</strong> Every bounce matters. Control your angle, momentum, and timing carefully—one small mistake can ruin everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem:</strong> Why struggle alone? Team up or race against friends to see who can master the pogo physics first.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb Out of an Impossible World:</strong> Travel through strange maps and surreal environments as you fight your way upward toward the only exit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Easy Way Out:</strong> There are no shortcuts. Falling means losing progress and having to climb back up again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for Rage:</strong> Narrow platforms, awkward landings, dangerous jumps, and physics that will test your patience to its limit.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925300/extras/e5d3e0a2e4f2034eebeedc594b092c7c.poster.avif?t=1788281852\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925300/extras/e5d3e0a2e4f2034eebeedc594b092c7c.webm?t=1788281852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925300/extras/e5d3e0a2e4f2034eebeedc594b092c7c.mp4?t=1788281852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why You’ll Love (to Hate) This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a dedicated test of skill and mental endurance. It strips away the safety nets, leaving only the player, the physics, and the climb. Every successful jump demands absolute precision, and every fall is an inevitable part of the journey back up. It is an experience designed for those who appreciate a relentless, high-stakes challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you reach the top… or will you stay trapped below forever?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"