/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb Out of an Impossible World:</strong> Travel through strange maps and surreal environments as you fight your way upward toward the only exit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Easy Way Out:</strong> There are no shortcuts. Falling means losing progress and having to climb back up again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for Rage:</strong> Narrow platforms, awkward landings, dangerous jumps, and physics that will test your patience to its limit.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925300/extras/e5d3e0a2e4f2034eebeedc594b092c7c.poster.avif?t=1788281852\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925300/extras/e5d3e0a2e4f2034eebeedc594b092c7c.webm?t=1788281852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925300/extras/e5d3e0a2e4f2034eebeedc594b092c7c.mp4?t=1788281852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why You’ll Love (to Hate) This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a dedicated test of skill and mental endurance. It strips away the safety nets, leaving only the player, the physics, and the climb. Every successful jump demands absolute precision, and every fall is an inevitable part of the journey back up. It is an experience designed for those who appreciate a relentless, high-stakes challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you reach the top… or will you stay trapped below forever?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Trapped with friends in a surreal world, your only way out is to bounce your way to the top. Master brutal physics, survive impossible obstacles, and face the climb together in this unforgi